                  <items count="16">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Fetches the reduced (catalog default) snapshot geometry as binary PLY from the CSC API, with ETag caching.
Input can be:
- Geometry carrying the 'csc_component' compose userstring
- A compose JSON string ({identity, snapshots[]})
- A raw identity_id (resolves the current snapshot)
- A raw snapshot_id

